    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "……他不知道我为什么生气。他永远不知道。我只是想让他记住我的生日，就一次……",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "世界安静了。\n*\"……他不知道我为什么生气。他永远不知道。我只是想让他记住我的生日，就一次……\"*"
  },
  {
