    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "简单的心声。浅层的委屈。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sets the cup down on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念放下杯子。代价应该很小——读心一个陌生人，失去的是一段无关紧要的记忆。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "她低头看手。左手手腕内侧——一道她不记得什么时候有的小划痕——消失了。\n无所谓。她甚至不记得那道划痕存在过。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian bends down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "告诉他你为什么生气。不是因为那件事，是因为生日。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "男孩回来了。苏念走过去，弯腰在女孩耳边轻声说了一句：\"告诉他你为什么生气。不是因为那件事，是因为生日。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
